// Self-only mobility burst (sheet range: Self). The sheet's own notes mark the Fire damage_type
// as trail flavor only, not a damage roll, so this ships as a pure movement buff with no damage
// component -- matching the sheet's own guidance, not a silent drop. Modeled with the existing
// Hastened buff (movement + attack speed), the same primitive already used elsewhere in this
// project for other self-only mobility buffs (e.g. axiomancy/gift_of_alacrity.ron).
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Hastened, data: BuffData(strength: 0.15, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 60.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Transmutation), source: Some(Primordial), cooldown: Some(30.0)),
)
